fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth265parser.html#gst_h265_parser_parse_decoder_config_record","fragment":"\n\tgst_h265_parser_parse_decoder_config_record\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265Parser.prototype.parse_decoder_config_record\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265Parser.parse_decoder_config_record\n\nParses HEVCDecoderConfigurationRecord data and fill into config.\nThe caller must free config via gst_h265_decoder_config_record_free\nThis method does not parse VPS, SPS and PPS and therefore the caller needs to\nparse each NAL unit via appropriate parsing method.\nParameters:\na GstH265Parser\nthe data to parse\nthe size of data\nparsed GstH265DecoderConfigRecord data\na GstH265ParserResult\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.24\n\t\t\nParses HEVCDecoderConfigurationRecord data and fill into config.\nThe caller must free config via GstCodecParsers.H265DecoderConfigRecord.prototype.free\nThis method does not parse VPS, SPS and PPS and therefore the caller needs to\nparse each NAL unit via appropriate parsing method.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H265Parser\nthe data to parse\nthe size of data\nReturns a tuple made of:\na GstCodecParsers.H265ParserResult\na GstCodecParsers.H265ParserResult\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.24\n\t\t\nParses HEVCDecoderConfigurationRecord data and fill into config.\nThe caller must free config via GstCodecParsers.H265DecoderConfigRecord.free\nThis method does not parse VPS, SPS and PPS and therefore the caller needs to\nparse each NAL unit via appropriate parsing method.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H265Parser\nthe data to parse\nthe size of data\nReturns a tuple made of:\na GstCodecParsers.H265ParserResult\na GstCodecParsers.H265ParserResult\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.24\n\t\t\n"});